{"thread":{"threadID":4058,"boardID":83,"topic":"35hp_dream_jail","time":1483200865,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","lastPostTime":1483780399,"lastPoster":"islo","replies":7,"views":486,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":7},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":57745,"threadID":4058,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"35hp_dream_jail","time":1483200865,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":7,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1483200919,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1483202289,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1483261734,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1483327848,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1483349171,"value":1},{"userID":2440,"username":"PowerPixel","time":1483374937,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1483531429,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Following up on Nachtfrische&#x27;s effort to enhance the map selection of the knife server, I published a new knife map, dedicated to dream, on the workshop today.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>It&#x27;s a jail themed 35hp knife map where players can fight upon 3 main stages.<br>Terrorists are spawned in jails while Counter-Terrorists are spawned in an armory, similiar to jail break.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Workshop Link:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=830945256\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Check it out on the workshop and leave a like to promote our community/servers.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Best regards &amp; have fun</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":57746,"threadID":4058,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1483200945,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attach